  "_": "Agentization Core design system for the Streamlit app — one face (Inter Variable), three application themes. The ONLY colour source for design/ac.css, .streamlit/config.toml (the default theme), Streamlit's runtime theme (ui_common.apply_theme) and the Plotly template. Red is reserved for discrepancies/alerts. White follows the Architect Wizard's light theme but carries no black fills: the current nav square and the tooltip stay white with gray edges, and the footer marks switch to gray-ink files. Status hues step darker on White (lighter on Gray) to keep text contrast. logoRule draws the footer band's rules. lensGlow / lensShadow light the nav name tag's glass: the glow is always light (a dark highlight read as a spot on White), the shadow soft on White.",
